-- AC datas : OLD Description : "El viejo Jim me da mucha pena. Antes no era así. Llevó una posada en la marisma durante un tiempo; un lugar fantástico.$b$bMira, no me apetece mucho hablar del tema. Si realmente quieres saber qué ocurrió, habla con el capitán Vimes. Está apostado en el piso de arriba de la Ciudadela Garrida, en los grandes barracones que hay al este de la torre de Lady Jaina.", Description AC enUS : "I can't help it if I feel sorry for ol' Jim there. He wasn't always like that. Ran an inn out in the marsh for a while, wonderful place.$b$bLook, I don't really want to talk about it. Bring it up with Captain Vimes if you really have to. He's stationed on the top floor of Foothold Citadel, the large barracks to the east of Lady Jaina's tower." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Captain Garran Vimes on the top floor of Foothold Citadel."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Habla con el capitán Garran Vimes que está en el piso de arriba de la Ciudadela Garrida.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esES' AND `ID` = 1282;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "", Description AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "$b        See if you've already completed this by typing:$b$b        /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(1283))"
