-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$n, me han pedido que te diera esto en cuanto terminaras de encargarte de los espías Roca Negra. Parece una carta sellada con la insignia de Llane, nuestro instructor de guerreros. Si fuera tú, la leería antes de hacer cualquier otra cosa en la Abadía.", Description AC enUS : "I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Llane, our local warrior trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Simple Letter and speak to Llane Beshere in Northshire Abbey."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Lee la carta simple y habla con Llane Beshere en la Abadía de Villanorte.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esES' AND `ID` = 3100;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$n, me han pedido que te diera esto en cuanto volvieras de los campamentos kóbold. Parece una carta sellada con la insignia del hermano Sammuel, nuestro instructor de paladines. Es mejor que la leas antes de dedicarte a cualquier otra cosa. ", Description AC enUS : "I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Brother Sammuel, our local paladin trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Consecrated Letter and speak to Brother Sammuel in Northshire Abbey."
