-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Ahora que has reunido todos los naipes de la baraja de Elementales, aparece misteriosamente un noveno naipe con el mismo reverso que los ocho primeros. Ese naipe tiene una inscripción: "Lleva estos naipes a la Feria de la Luna Negra y recibe tu recompensa". Has oído que la entrada a esa feria aparece cada mes cerca de Mulgore y Villadorada.", Description AC enUS : "Now that you have gathered all of the Elemental cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight.   On this card is inscribed, "Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded."   You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the Elementals Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town."
