-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Objetivo: los oteadores de Colmen'Zora", Title AC enUS : "Target: Hive'Zora Waywatchers" ; Wowhead enUS : "Target: Hive'Zora Waywatchers",  OLD Description : "Se han pedido refuerzos para unirse al asalto a Colmen'Zora. Te han seleccionado para atacar a los oteadores de Colmen'Zora. Informa a la comandante Mar’alith cuando hayas completado tu misión.", Description AC enUS : "Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora waywatchers.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task." ; Wowhead enUS : "Slay 30 Hive'Zora Waywatchers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest."
