-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Has elegido tu camino, $c. Ahora debes seguirlo te lleve adonde te lleve.$b$bVerás que tener amigos entre los archimagos de Dalaran tiene sus ventajas. Sírvenos bien y tus deseos no pasarán desapercibidos.", Description AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Honored reputation with the Violet Eye."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Entrega tu sello Violeta a la archimaga Leryda en el Paso de la Muerte tras obtener reputación honorable con El Ojo Violeta.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esES' AND `ID` = 10733;
