-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Forward Base: Reaver's Fall REUSE", Title AC enUS : "Forward Base: Reaver's Fall REUSE" ; Wowhead enUS : "Forward Base: Reaver's Fall REUSE",  OLD Description : "El alto mando ha oído hablar de tus proezas en combate, $c. Quieren que vayas a unirte a la gente de Puñolisiado. Son unos radicales obsesionados con exterminar a la Legión Ardiente; te llevarás bien con ellos.$B$BCamina unos 200 pasos hacia el este y gira hacia el sur en el saliente de tierra. Verás la Caída del Atracador Vil y las ruinas de una granja. Preséntate ante el comandante de vanguardia To'arch.$B$B¡Y ahora en marcha!", Description AC enUS : "Your battle prowess has been noted by high command, $c. They want to send you to the front lines to meet up with Maimfist's crew. They're radicals, devoted to the complete extermination of the Burning Legion, so you may fit right in...$B$BHead east about 200 paces and veer south at the jutting mass of land. You'll see Reaver's Fall where an old farm used to stand. Once there, you are to report to Foward Commander To'arch.$B$BNow move out!" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Report to Forward Commander To'arch at Reaver's Fall."
