-- AC datas : OLD Description : "No, no... Las coges tú.$b$bNo esperarías que las llevara yo después de todo lo que has hecho, ¿verdad?$b$bEsto es lo que vas a hacer...", Description AC enUS : "No, no... You hold on to these.$b$bYou didn't actually expect me to handle them after all of that did you?$b$bhere's what you're going to do...." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game."
