-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Te has ganado mi respeto y el de tus compañeros. Has derrotado a todo el que te ha desafiado y dominas el combate en torneo. ¡No dudo de que estás $gpreparado:preparada; para enfrentarte a los campeones de otras ciudades por la gloria de Orgrimmar!$b$bLa justicar Mariel Corazón Veraz ha solicitado hablar contigo, $n, e introducirte formalmente en el gran combate cuerpo a cuerpo de los campeones.", Description AC enUS : "You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Orgrimmar!$B$BJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, $N, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds."
