-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Este libro de contabilidad está lleno de lugares y necesito que los investigues y tomes medidas, $gamigo:amiga;. Esto tiene que acabar.$b$bEsta es la entrada que quiero que investigues: está en Cuna del Invierno, justo al este de Vista Eterna. Ah, ahora sí es algo personal. Ve y dales una paliza.$b$bAh, y si ves algo grande y peligroso que haya que destruir, tírale esta bomba.", Description AC enUS : "This ledger is full of locations, and I need you to investigate and take action, pal. This has gone on long enough.$b$bHere's an entry I want you to check out: it's in Winterspring, just east of Everlook. Oh, now this is personal. Get out there and rough 'em up.$b$bOh, and if you see something big and dangerous enough that it needs destroying, toss this bomb at it." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Kill 5 Crown Sprinklers and use Snagglebolt's Khorium Bomb to destroy one chemical wagon east of Everlook in Winterspring, then return to Detective Snap Snagglebolt in Orgrimmar."
